--
-- Primary restore path (preferred):
--   1) Keep current production intact for non-learning objects.
--   2) Restore ONLY learning tables from custom dump:
--        academy_learning_tables.pgdump
--      using pg_restore --no-owner --no-privileges
--      (requires academy_users rows referenced by FKs to still exist)
--   3) Re-apply permission rows + role links:
--        learning_permissions_restore.sql
--   4) Re-run preflight counts and compare to manifest.json
--
-- Full disaster path (if schema also damaged):
--   Use full_schema.sql + full_data.sql from the same backup directory.
--   Prefer restoring into a disposable DB first, then selectively copy
